    <title>Vol.007｜对话田柯宇：我发誓我说的都是真的</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6acd2c76e742e36efcc1fe3a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6acd2c76e742e36efcc1fe3a</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期「elsewhere」，对话了一个话题人物——田柯宇。也就是很多人口中的“字节投毒实习生”。</span></p><p><span>这是一个各种戏剧元素都过于饱满的故事。在很多人眼中，田柯宇就是个大坏蛋。甚至有人喊他牢田——牢狱的牢。</span></p><p><span>今年7月，我们和田柯宇录了这期播客。其中，他首次完整地讲述了他的所见和前因后果，包括他为什么要这么做、具体做了什么，什么是他承认的、什么是他认为自己被污名化的。除此之外，也包括他更早年的求学和学术选择，这可以帮助我们更多地理解田柯宇这个人。</span></p><p><span>当然，关于他的世界模型方向的创业，我们也聊了聊。</span></p><p><span>需要解释一下，这个访谈距今已经过去三个多月，其中的一些表达，和当下的情况和市场语境可能会有一些差别，比如和世界模型相关的许多事情等等。</span></p><p><span>这整件事更像是个社会或法治新闻。其中除了田柯宇，还牵涉到几方当事人，比如字节、一个田柯宇提到的另一个实习生，以及一些相关的人。</span></p><p><span>每个人都会有自己看到、以及相信的真相。以下是我们和田柯宇的对话。</span></p><p><strong><span>🎙️ Voices</span></strong></p><p><span>田柯宇｜基座模型创业者</span></p><p><span>刘旌｜elsewhere别处发生</span></p><p><strong><span>📀 BGM</span></strong></p><p><span>Burn The Witch - Radiohead</span></p><p><strong><span>📱 Socials</span></strong></p><p><span>公众号｜视频号｜</span><a href="https://xhslink.com/m/6eWeP9XWetm" data-url="https://xhslink.com/m/6eWeP9XWetm"><span>小红书</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://b23.tv/V7sJ8yY" data-url="https://b23.tv/V7sJ8yY"><span>Bilibili</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://okjk.co/mKgqlp" data-url="https://okjk.co/mKgqlp"><span>即刻</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/68ff657d9c745a6e69da8fcf" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/68ff657d9c745a6e69da8fcf"><span>小宇宙</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/cn/podcast/elsewhere%E5%88%AB%E5%A4%84%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F/id1862365307" data-url="https://podcasts.apple.com/cn/podcast/elsewhere%E5%88%AB%E5%A4%84%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F/id1862365307"><span>Apple Podcast</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@elsewhere_news" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/@elsewhere_news"><span>YouTube</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://elsewherenews.substack.com/" data-url="https://elsewherenews.substack.com/"><span>Substack</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://x.com/elsewhere_news" data-url="https://x.com/elsewhere_news"><span>X/Twitter</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/elsewhere-news/" data-url="https://www.linkedin.com/company/elsewhere-news/"><span>Linkedin</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="http://elsewhere.news" data-url="http://elsewhere.news"><span>elsewhere.news</span></a></p><p><span>⏱️ </span><strong><span>Timestamps</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><strong><span>Part 1: 字节"投毒"事件</span></strong></p></li></ul><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="122">00:02:02</a> 另一个实习生</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="511">00:08:31</a> GitHub 帖子</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="945">00:15:45</a> 行侠仗义？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1412">00:23:32</a> 为什么后来变成了诉讼</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1836">00:30:36</a> 拿到 NeurIPS Best Paper</span></p><ul><li><p><strong><span>Part 2: 科研、创业、世界模型</span></strong></p></li></ul><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2282">00:38:02</a> 事件带来的关注度，是创业的"双重 buff"</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2883">00:48:03</a> 从喜欢化学到转系编程</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3614">01:00:14</a> 什么是世界模型</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4343">01:12:23</a> 比起蒸馏人类，我更想蒸馏自然</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5080">01:24:40</a> data model fit</span></p><ul><li><p><strong><span>Part 3: 你能发誓你所讲的都是真的吗？</span></strong></p></li></ul><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5606">01:33:26</a> 还是很感激字节</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5824">01:37:04</a> 你能发誓你讲的都是真的吗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6283">01:44:43</a> 兔子、MJ和怜爱</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6778">01:52:58</a> 假如 AGI 实现了，会想做什么</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/68ff657d9c745a6e69da8fcf/lq719vhbMd1uwMt-RoSKRPPCNHtJ.m4a" length="113185120" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:56:32</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpir5HF5YzilkS0kfkLMJz9GOxcW.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.006｜对话孟醒：我很怕和别人一样</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a7e605c36641f136d87e78c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a7e605c36641f136d87e78c</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 01:40:12 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今天这一期，是我对五源资本合伙人孟醒的访谈。</span></p><p><span>很多人大体知道孟醒的故事：做过投行、创过两次业、干过几年科技投资，又加入大厂——也就是滴滴，负责过自动驾驶业务。直到2024年，又回到投资行业。</span></p><p><span>怎么说呢，按照结果更大化的标尺，孟醒的职业生涯有些横跳。就在和他录播客的前后几天，他在顺为做投资时投的第二个公司—— Momenta 上市了。</span></p><p><span>当年他之所以离开顺为资本、去滴滴，一个很重要的原因就是，有一次他坐高铁经过苏州北站，看到 Momenta 的大 logo ，瞬间觉得自己根本不上曹旭东的成长速度。</span></p><p><span>但在今天，他的投资生涯似乎又在重新开始。于是我问他：会不会总有一种摘下的种子、却没有尝到果实的郁闷？</span></p><p><span>孟醒说，他的人生驱动力是体验，以及不同。在我们剪完的视频里，“体验”出现了多达32次，“不同”出现了16次。</span></p><p><span>还有一个令我意外的收获。</span></p><p><span>我一直觉得孟醒是个硅谷范儿、开朗明媚的人。但这次访谈发现了他反差的另一面：这与他的童年有关，与他的世界观有关。</span></p><p><span>具体是什么，先卖个关子。相信看完后，你会有一些新的发现。</span></p><p><strong><span>🎙️ Voices</span></strong></p><p><span>孟醒｜五源资本合伙人</span></p><p><span>刘旌｜elsewhere别处发生</span></p><p><strong><span>📀 BGM</span></strong></p><p><span>Can You Feel It - Jean Roch</span></p><p><strong><span>📱 Socials</span></strong></p><p><span>公众号｜视频号｜</span><a href="https://xhslink.com/m/6eWeP9XWetm" data-url="https://xhslink.com/m/6eWeP9XWetm"><span>小红书</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://b23.tv/V7sJ8yY" data-url="https://b23.tv/V7sJ8yY"><span>Bilibili</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://okjk.co/mKgqlp" data-url="https://okjk.co/mKgqlp"><span>即刻</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/68ff657d9c745a6e69da8fcf" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/68ff657d9c745a6e69da8fcf"><span>小宇宙</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/cn/podcast/elsewhere%E5%88%AB%E5%A4%84%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F/id1862365307" data-url="https://podcasts.apple.com/cn/podcast/elsewhere%E5%88%AB%E5%A4%84%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F/id1862365307"><span>Apple Podcast</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@elsewhere_news" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/@elsewhere_news"><span>YouTube</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://elsewherenews.substack.com/" data-url="https://elsewherenews.substack.com/"><span>Substack</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://x.com/elsewhere_news" data-url="https://x.com/elsewhere_news"><span>X/Twitter</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/elsewhere-news/" data-url="https://www.linkedin.com/company/elsewhere-news/"><span>Linkedin</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="http://elsewhere.news" data-url="http://elsewhere.news"><span>elsewhere.news</span></a></p><p><strong><span>⏱️ Timestamps</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><strong><span>Part1 我很怕相同</span></strong></p></li></ul><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="428">00:07:08</a> 从 Odin、Leo、田柯宇说起</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="893">00:14:53</a> 是容易被故事吸引吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1831">00:30:31</a> 为什么一定要不同？</span></p><ul><li><p><strong><span>Part2 创业、顺为与滴滴</span></strong></p></li></ul><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2481">00:41:21</a> 两段创业后，为什么做投资？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3013">00:50:13</a> Momenta和在顺为的时光</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3252">00:54:12</a> 去滴滴，做自动驾驶COO</span></p><ul><li><p><strong><span>Part3 流浪 流浪 流浪</span></strong></p></li></ul><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3844">01:04:04</a> 回到投资行业</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4388">01:13:08</a> 既独特又大众，可能只有王菲吧</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4768">01:19:28</a> 我不想光着膀子在老唐楼里吃饭</span></p><p><strong><span>🧩 Team</span></strong></p><p><span>制作人：郭允骁</span></p><p><span>拍摄制作：播客公社｜OPS播客空间</span></p><p><span>策划 / 导播：老袁</span></p><p><span>项目经理：村长（刘超凡）</span></p><p><span>摄像指导：刘焱</span></p><p><span>视频制作：刘焱</span></p><p><span>音频制作：图图</span></p><p><span>视觉设计：Wing（潮声志）</span></p><p><span>灯光设计：臧尊壮团队</span></p><p><span>场地支持：alahouse</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/68ff657d9c745a6e69da8fcf/lmVbo0r2kLDuTe8410gde64g_e62.m4a" length="89987490" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:32:39</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj3Xf1eXANUFNtXmJ_HjxqQUmOSK.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.005｜对话公元：而我选择，另开一桌</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69ddd955b977fb2c47e460d6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69ddd955b977fb2c47e460d6</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 14 Apr 2026 08:27:42 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>热烈欢迎，「elsewhere」的第一个女性采访对象：公元。</span></p><p><span>印象中，公元一直与一些新鲜的事情有关：2018年，VC行业还沉溺在共享经济的漩涡里，还在华创资本的公元，就已经和科技圈打成一片；加入红杉后，她又整了个HongshanX出来，一会发paper，一会孵化科学家，有点神神秘秘的。</span></p><p><span>总之，公元不是个依恋延长线的人。她自己将这种行为逻辑定义为：另开一桌。</span></p><p><span>在对公元的访谈里，除了她个人的成长历程——比如如何阴错阳差来到VC行业；怎么从一家早期VC加入红杉；以及成为合伙人的历程，我们也花了相当长的篇幅去讨论更多关于红杉的话题，比如他们的投委会是怎构成的；为什么红杉会拥有一种几乎绝无仅有的组织形态；以及红杉文化的核心到底是什么等等。</span></p><p><span>历史上关于红杉的内容很多，但这些都少有被揭秘过。</span></p><h2><strong><span>🎙️ Voices</span></strong></h2><p><span>公元｜红杉中国合伙人</span></p><p><span>刘旌｜elsewhere别处发生</span></p><h2><strong><span>📀 BGM</span></strong></h2><p><span>Extraordinary Machine - Fiona Apple</span></p><h2><strong><span>📱 Socials</span></strong></h2><p><span>公众号｜视频号｜</span><a href="https://xhslink.com/m/6eWeP9XWetm" data-url="https://xhslink.com/m/6eWeP9XWetm"><span>小红书</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://b23.tv/V7sJ8yY" data-url="https://b23.tv/V7sJ8yY"><span>Bilibili</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://okjk.co/mKgqlp" data-url="https://okjk.co/mKgqlp"><span>即刻</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/68ff657d9c745a6e69da8fcf" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/68ff657d9c745a6e69da8fcf"><span>小宇宙</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/cn/podcast/elsewhere%E5%88%AB%E5%A4%84%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F/id1862365307" data-url="https://podcasts.apple.com/cn/podcast/elsewhere%E5%88%AB%E5%A4%84%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F/id1862365307"><span>Apple Podcast</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@elsewhere_news" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/@elsewhere_news"><span>YouTube</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://elsewherenews.substack.com/" data-url="https://elsewherenews.substack.com/"><span>Substack</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://x.com/elsewhere_news" data-url="https://x.com/elsewhere_news"><span>X/Twitter</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/elsewhere-news/" data-url="https://www.linkedin.com/company/elsewhere-news/"><span>Linkedin</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="http://elsewhere.news" data-url="http://elsewhere.news"><span>elsewhere.news</span></a></p><h2><strong><span>⏱️ Timestamps</span></strong></h2><ul><li><p><strong><span>Part1 发论文的VC</span></strong></p></li></ul><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="252">00:04:12</a> Xbench发了一篇论文</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="424">00:07:04</a> 做科学家的 co-founder</span></p><ul><li><p><strong><span>Part2 从硅谷到北京</span></strong></p></li></ul><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="584">00:09:44</a> 从硅谷回国的 identity crisis</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="840">00:14:00</a> 加入华创，但做的是 Venture Lending</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="984">00:16:24</a> 满桌大佬，另开一桌</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1202">00:20:02</a> 和科学家交朋友</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1672">00:27:52</a> 跟江湖师傅学做VC</span></p><ul><li><p><strong><span>Part3 红杉是浓缩的中国一级市场</span></strong></p></li></ul><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1840">00:30:40</a> 科技ToB大迁徙，从华创到红杉</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2287">00:38:07</a> 来红杉，依然是和市场的竞争</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2425">00:40:25</a> 爬同一座山，和红杉同事一起会快很多</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2643">00:44:03</a> “公司上市的那天，你朋友圈发什么？”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3021">00:50:21</a> IC的本质是市场的缩影和conviction的表达</span></p><ul><li><p><strong><span>Part4 HongShanX</span></strong></p></li></ul><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3411">00:56:51</a> Sabbatical “学术假期”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3668">01:01:08</a> HongShanX的雏形</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4096">01:08:16</a> 每次孵化，都想过“加入这家公司得了”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4686">01:18:06</a> 投资人在创业者身上寻找映射是种ego</span></p><ul><li><p><strong><span>Part5 新Partner / 新一代“卷王”</span></strong></p></li></ul><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4963">01:22:43</a> 年夜饭前，Neil打来的电话</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5129">01:25:29</a> 红杉文化的本质是：赢和conviction</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5932">01:38:52</a> 华创的老同事问：2019年对自己的期待做到了吗？</span></p><h2><span>🧩 Team</span></h2><p><span>制作人：郭允骁</span></p><p><span>拍摄制作：播客公社｜OPS播客空间</span></p><p><span>策划 / 导播：老袁</span></p><p><span>项目经理：村长（刘超凡）</span></p><p><span>摄像指导：刘焱</span></p><p><span>视频制作：刘焱</span></p><p><span>音频制作：图图</span></p><p><span>视觉设计：Wing（潮声志）</span></p><p><span>灯光设计：臧尊壮团队</span></p><p><span>场地支持：alahouse</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/68ff657d9c745a6e69da8fcf/ljgxV1-AvmxXJ4JGbDitnQty-OoF.m4a" length="98613957" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:41:31</itunes:duration>
