  <item>
    <title>Sp.02｜对话董师傅：中国风险投资20年的幕后故事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6999aa4266e2c30377f2a8c4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6999aa4266e2c30377f2a8c4</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 22 Feb 2026 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>「elsewhere」的听众朋友们，新年快乐！</span></p><p><span>今天是一期编外的内容。去年年底，我和人称董师傅的投中网总编辑董力瀚聊了一期。缘起是，他和投中的编辑部团队 ，当时刚出了一本中国版的《Power Law》——《中国风险投资史》。</span></p><p><span>书中尽数了过去二十年中国VC行业的雄姿英发、羽扇纶巾。</span></p><p><span>作为同行，我一直好奇在文章之外，董老师还会怎么描述投资行业。所以我们谈到了许多知名风投家、他们的心性，以及他们为何如此构筑基金风格：比如沈南鹏、朱啸虎、张颖、林欣禾、邝子平等等。</span></p><p><span>很多观察角度，都很董老师。</span></p><p><span>之前「elsewhere」</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6939783637f52a644e3ab538" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6939783637f52a644e3ab538"><span>对谈真格基金刘元</span></a><span>时，他开玩笑说我们都是“误入了这个行业的人”。我觉得这个评价似乎更适合董老师。</span></p><p><span>好了，来听听董老师是怎么锐评中国VC行业的吧！</span></p><p><span>再次祝大家新年快乐，一年比一年更快乐！</span></p><h2><span>🎙️ Voices</span></h2><p><span>董力瀚｜投中网总编辑</span></p><p><span>刘旌｜elsewhere别处发生</span></p><h2><span>📀 BGM</span></h2><p><span>Anchorless Ship - The Fin.</span></p><h2><span>📱 Socials</span></h2><p><span>公众号｜视频号｜</span><a href="https://xhslink.com/m/6eWeP9XWetm" data-url="https://xhslink.com/m/6eWeP9XWetm"><span>小红书</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://b23.tv/V7sJ8yY" data-url="https://b23.tv/V7sJ8yY"><span>Bilibili</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://okjk.co/mKgqlp" data-url="https://okjk.co/mKgqlp"><span>即刻</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/68ff657d9c745a6e69da8fcf" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/68ff657d9c745a6e69da8fcf"><span>小宇宙</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/cn/podcast/elsewhere%E5%88%AB%E5%A4%84%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F/id1862365307" data-url="https://podcasts.apple.com/cn/podcast/elsewhere%E5%88%AB%E5%A4%84%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F/id1862365307"><span>Apple Podcast</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@elsewhere_news" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/@elsewhere_news"><span>YouTube</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://elsewherenews.substack.com/" data-url="https://elsewherenews.substack.com/"><span>Substack</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://x.com/elsewhere_news" data-url="https://x.com/elsewhere_news"><span>X/Twitter</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/elsewhere-news/" data-url="https://www.linkedin.com/company/elsewhere-news/"><span>Linkedin</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="http://elsewhere.news" data-url="http://elsewhere.news"><span>elsewhere.news</span></a></p><h2><span>⏱️ Timestamps</span></h2><ul><li><p><strong><span>Part1 《中国风险投资史》</span></strong></p></li></ul><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="356">00:05:56</a> 先从新书聊起</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="789">00:13:09</a> 时代会奖励对应属性的人才</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1191">00:19:51</a> 采访对象：碰见谁就跟谁聊</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1843">00:30:43</a> 第一章从价值观开始写</span></p><ul><li><p><strong><span>Part2 大佬往事</span></strong></p></li></ul><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2050">00:34:10</a> 重点描摹的风投家，还是张磊沈南鹏</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2283">00:38:03</a> 朱啸虎和张颖：反叛与网感</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2462">00:41:02</a> 奇异的林欣禾和平权的邝子平</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2769">00:46:09</a> 董师傅入行时的投资人们</span></p><ul><li><p><strong><span>Part3 投资人报道</span></strong></p></li></ul><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2992">00:49:52</a> 为什么世界上会有一种报道叫投资人报道</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3356">00:55:56</a> 这行最难的就是搞定别人，包凡身上就是这个东西</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3398">00:56:38</a> 来到红杉，看得更清楚一点</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3754">01:02:34</a> 关于高瓴的同题作文</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4015">01:06:55</a> 一些闲聊：社交、窦文涛、投中的内容、AI行业</span></p><h2><span>🧩 Team</span></h2><p><span>制作人：郭允骁</span></p><p><span>拍摄制作：播客公社｜OPS播客空间</span></p><p><span>策划 / 导播：老袁</span></p><p><span>项目经理：村长（刘超凡）</span></p><p><span>摄像指导：刘焱</span></p><p><span>视频制作：刘焱</span></p><p><span>音频制作：图图</span></p><p><span>视觉设计：Wing（潮声志）</span></p><p><span>灯光设计：臧尊壮团队</span></p><p><span>场地支持：alahouse</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/68ff657d9c745a6e69da8fcf/lhxLid5lmY7EQc8giBOm3ip8bi7s.m4a" length="71811602" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:13:56</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlhJOdwwGsIb8fVdjn8xFZlXbI9t.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.004｜对话郭山汕：不入江湖，但要继续赢</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69849c5d70aae7e967c4a178</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69849c5d70aae7e967c4a178</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 06 Feb 2026 03:14:18 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在「elsewhere」对</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6949682f0b60b7bf75e1dade" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6949682f0b60b7bf75e1dade"><span>王华东的访谈</span></a><span>里，我们聊起过一个人：一个也宣称自己无聊的投资人。</span></p><p><span>这个人就是郭山汕。</span></p><p><span>郭山汕很低调。如果不是投资行业的人，都未必知道他。但他投资过：拼多多、小红书、鸣鸣很忙、中通快递、极兔快递、安能物流、满帮、货拉拉、BOSS 直聘、智元机器人等等。</span></p><p><span>他带来的基金回报超过百亿美金，且横跨不同行业和阶段，是中国投资行业业绩最突出的年轻合伙人之一。</span></p><p><span>但在去年，在加入红杉15年之后，他转任投资合伙人，创办了卓飞投资（Entropy Management）。这是一个主要投资二级、以及支持公益的新基金。</span></p><p><span>他为什么会做出这个选择？</span></p><h2><span>🎙️ Voices</span></h2><p><span>郭山汕｜卓飞投资创始人</span></p><p><span>刘旌｜elsewhere别处发生</span></p><h2><span>📀 BGM</span></h2><p><span>任我行 - 陈奕迅</span></p><h2><span>📱 Socials</span></h2><p><span>公众号｜视频号｜</span><a href="https://xhslink.com/m/6eWeP9XWetm" data-url="https://xhslink.com/m/6eWeP9XWetm"><span>小红书</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://b23.tv/V7sJ8yY" data-url="https://b23.tv/V7sJ8yY"><span>Bilibili</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://okjk.co/mKgqlp" data-url="https://okjk.co/mKgqlp"><span>即刻</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/68ff657d9c745a6e69da8fcf" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/68ff657d9c745a6e69da8fcf"><span>小宇宙</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/cn/podcast/elsewhere%E5%88%AB%E5%A4%84%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F/id1862365307" data-url="https://podcasts.apple.com/cn/podcast/elsewhere%E5%88%AB%E5%A4%84%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F/id1862365307"><span>Apple Podcast</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@elsewhere_news" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/@elsewhere_news"><span>YouTube</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://elsewherenews.substack.com/" data-url="https://elsewherenews.substack.com/"><span>Substack</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://x.com/elsewhere_news" data-url="https://x.com/elsewhere_news"><span>X/Twitter</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/elsewhere-news/" data-url="https://www.linkedin.com/company/elsewhere-news/"><span>Linkedin</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="http://elsewhere.news" data-url="http://elsewhere.news"><span>elsewhere.news</span></a></p><h2><span>⏱️ Timestamps</span></h2><ul><li><p><strong><span>Part1 在红杉看物流</span></strong></p></li></ul><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="265">00:04:25</a> 早年经历：西门子和麦肯锡</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="581">00:09:41</a> 来到红杉：你相信我，我相信你</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="807">00:13:27</a> cold call投到中通快递</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1600">00:26:40</a> 顺藤摸瓜，发现安能物流</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2019">00:33:39</a> 物流行业是一个江湖</span></p><ul><li><p><strong><span>Part2 尽调投资拼多多</span></strong></p></li></ul><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2281">00:38:01</a> 我和黄峥都叫Colin</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2437">00:40:37</a> 下单了猕猴桃和厨房纸</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2710">00:45:10</a> 这个东西投少了就没意思了，我赌上职业生涯</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2830">00:47:10</a> 尽调拼多多的细节</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3406">00:56:46</a> 升partner、拼多多过会、和太太领证，在同一个月</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3836">01:03:56</a> 成功投资的意义是赢得信任</span></p><ul><li><p><strong><span>Part3 in all</span></strong></p></li></ul><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4069">01:07:49</a> 一级和二级不是同一个物种</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4633">01:17:13</a> 我害怕退步，想赢的人是这样的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5288">01:28:08</a> 我有一个特异功能：看吃播就饱了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5528">01:32:08</a> 如果年轻十岁，或者可以活两辈子</span></p><h2><span>🧩 Team</span></h2><p><span>制作人：郭允骁</span></p><p><span>拍摄制作：播客公社｜OPS播客空间</span></p><p><span>策划 / 导播：老袁</span></p><p><span>项目经理：村长（刘超凡）</span></p><p><span>摄像指导：刘焱</span></p><p><span>视频制作：刘焱</span></p><p><span>音频制作：图图</span></p><p><span>视觉设计：Wing（潮声志）</span></p><p><span>灯光设计：臧尊壮团队</span></p><p><span>场地支持：alahouse</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/68ff657d9c745a6e69da8fcf/lmMsJOrgfT8ZdvBiW8QKUXHS3DFk.m4a" length="94620065" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:37:25</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnam7ONnUu5b_LXv_cqQaSefH2ia.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.003｜对话黄云刚：从在新疆搬砖到做VC，我的人生折叠</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69708b2def1cf272a7a130ca</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69708b2def1cf272a7a130ca</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 21 Jan 2026 10:12:35 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是一个真实的投资人故事。但又真实到不像是一个投资人的故事。</span></p><p><span>简单来说，这就是一个寒门之子的逆天改命：他从新疆阿克苏、来到杭州求学、又在北京成立了自己的基金：源码律动。此前他还投资过快的打车、悦刻、Kimi等公司。</span></p><p><span>其中最值得讲述的，是他的绿皮火车之旅。这些短则几个小时、长则7天七夜的火车途中，他看过残酷的打斗，真实的人性，他自己有一次甚至差点半路挂掉。至今他还保留着那些火车票根。</span></p><p><span>他说，很多场景很像那部电影：《天下无贼》。</span></p><h2><strong><span>🎙️ Voices</span></strong></h2><p><span>黄云刚｜源码律动管理合伙人</span></p><p><span>刘旌｜elsewhere别处发生</span></p><h2><strong><span>📀 BGM</span></strong></h2><p><span>夜晚出生的小孩 - 艾怡良</span></p><h2><strong><span>📱 Socials</span></strong></h2><p><span>公众号｜视频号｜</span><a href="https://xhslink.com/m/6eWeP9XWetm" data-url="https://xhslink.com/m/6eWeP9XWetm"><span>小红书</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://b23.tv/V7sJ8yY" data-url="https://b23.tv/V7sJ8yY"><span>Bilibili</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://okjk.co/mKgqlp" data-url="https://okjk.co/mKgqlp"><span>即刻</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/68ff657d9c745a6e69da8fcf" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/68ff657d9c745a6e69da8fcf"><span>小宇宙</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/cn/podcast/elsewhere%E5%88%AB%E5%A4%84%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F/id1862365307" data-url="https://podcasts.apple.com/cn/podcast/elsewhere%E5%88%AB%E5%A4%84%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F/id1862365307"><span>Apple Podcast</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@elsewhere_news" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/@elsewhere_news"><span>YouTube</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://elsewherenews.substack.com/" data-url="https://elsewherenews.substack.com/"><span>Substack</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://x.com/elsewhere_news" data-url="https://x.com/elsewhere_news"><span>X/Twitter</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/elsewhere-news/" data-url="https://www.linkedin.com/company/elsewhere-news/"><span>Linkedin</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="http://elsewhere.news" data-url="http://elsewhere.news"><span>elsewhere.news</span></a></p><h2><span>⏱️ Timestamps</span></h2><ul><li><p><strong><span>Part1 从阿克苏走出的男孩</span></strong></p></li></ul><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="189">00:03:09</a> 从四川山村到新疆戈壁</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="529">00:08:49</a> 读书改变命运</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="939">00:15:39</a> 校园霸凌</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1192">00:19:52</a> 漫长的绿皮火车</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2001">00:33:21</a> 浙大的校园生活</span></p><ul><li><p><strong><span>Part2 经纬的日子和那一夜</span></strong></p></li></ul><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2320">00:38:40</a> 腾讯的HR实习和招聘平台的观察</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2532">00:42:12</a> 加入经纬</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2761">00:46:01</a> 投资快的的故事</span></p><ul><li><p><strong><span>Part3 源码空降合伙人</span></strong></p></li></ul><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4331">01:12:11</a> 和曹毅的相识</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4453">01:14:13</a> 投资悦刻的故事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4752">01:19:12</a> 在源码的自我证明</span></p><ul><li><p><strong><span>Part4 源码律动和四十不惑的黄云刚</span></strong></p></li></ul><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5333">01:28:53</a> 源码律动的进展</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5459">01:30:59</a> “朋友说你像虚竹和傅红雪”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6074">01:41:14</a> 当男孩回到他的阿克苏</span></p><h2><strong><span>🧩 Team</span></strong></h2><p><span>制作人：郭允骁</span></p><p><span>拍摄制作：播客公社｜OPS播客空间</span></p><p><span>策划 / 导播：老袁</span></p><p><span>项目经理：村长（刘超凡）</span></p><p><span>摄像指导：刘焱</span></p><p><span>视频制作：刘焱</span></p><p><span>音频制作：图图</span></p><p><span>视觉设计：Wing（潮声志）</span></p><p><span>灯光设计：臧尊壮团队</span></p><p><span>场地支持：alahouse</span></p>]]></description>
