  <item>
    <title>Sp.01｜复盘中国一级市场的2025（Ft.十字路口）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6952255f14db1df9ef45d270</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6952255f14db1df9ef45d270</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 29 Dec 2025 07:04:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今天是一期特别的节目，因为在这一期里，我不是那个主要提问的人，是有另外一个人在向我提问。</span></p><p><span>这个人就是十字路口的创始人，也是真格基金的投资合伙人Koji，去年差不多也在这个时候，Koji也拉我聊过一期，大概主题就是过去一年的中国一级市场状况，所以这也算是一个年更栏目。这一期里Koji问了我很多问题，很难说我掌握的一定是最准确的，但我尽量知无不言。</span></p><p><span>另外我也问了一个我对Koji最好奇的问题：在今天这样一个高速又变化多端的年代，作为一个创业者，也是一位投资人，同时也是一个KOL，他认为应该用怎样的姿态在面对今天的时代？应该如何调配赞美和批判的比例？那个适当的姿势应该是怎样的？</span></p><p><span>串台 </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/60502e253c92d4f62c2a9577" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/60502e253c92d4f62c2a9577"><span>@十字路口Crossing</span></a></p><h2><span>🎙️ Voices</span></h2><p><span>杨远骋Koji｜十字路口创始人</span></p><p><span>刘旌｜elsewhere别处发生</span></p><p><span>📀 BGM</span></p><p><span>Happy Together - 钟定一</span></p><h2><strong><span>📱 Socials</span></strong></h2><p><span>公众号｜视频号｜</span><a href="https://xhslink.com/m/6eWeP9XWetm" data-url="https://xhslink.com/m/6eWeP9XWetm"><span>小红书</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://b23.tv/V7sJ8yY" data-url="https://b23.tv/V7sJ8yY"><span>Bilibili</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://okjk.co/mKgqlp" data-url="https://okjk.co/mKgqlp"><span>即刻</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/68ff657d9c745a6e69da8fcf" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/68ff657d9c745a6e69da8fcf"><span>小宇宙</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/cn/podcast/elsewhere%E5%88%AB%E5%A4%84%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F/id1862365307" data-url="https://podcasts.apple.com/cn/podcast/elsewhere%E5%88%AB%E5%A4%84%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F/id1862365307"><span>Apple Podcast</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@elsewhere_news" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/@elsewhere_news"><span>YouTube</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://elsewherenews.substack.com/" data-url="https://elsewherenews.substack.com/"><span>Substack</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://x.com/elsewhere_news" data-url="https://x.com/elsewhere_news"><span>X/Twitter</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/elsewhere-news/" data-url="https://www.linkedin.com/company/elsewhere-news/"><span>Linkedin</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="http://elsewhere.news" data-url="http://elsewhere.news"><span>elsewhere.news</span></a></p><h2><span>⏱️ Timestamps</span></h2><ul><li><p><strong><span>2025的中国一级市场</span></strong></p></li></ul><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="417">00:06:57</a> 刘元与Manus、李丰与影石</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="581">00:09:41</a> 新一代GP卡位战</span></p><ul><li><p><strong><span>不同行业的融资现状</span></strong></p></li></ul><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="662">00:11:02</a> 大模型：故事仍在继续</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1028">00:17:08</a> 软件：中国创业公司也能做出惊艳产品</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1264">00:21:04</a> 硬件：中国机会，迅速成为共识</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1522">00:25:22</a> 机器人：滚滚向前</span></p><ul><li><p><strong><span>投资机构们的新变化</span></strong></p></li></ul><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1732">00:28:52</a> 大的共识、小的分歧</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1875">00:31:15</a> 主流基金：红杉高瓴IDG启明经纬……</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2231">00:37:11</a> 互联网CVC：阿里蚂蚁百度美团京东小红书……</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2388">00:39:48</a> SoloGP：Alphaist、Creek Stone、小小基金、赵长鹏、王慧文……</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2550">00:42:30</a> 加速器：深圳科创学院、Spark Lab、奇绩创坛、各大云厂商……</span></p><ul><li><p><strong><span>一些关于基金和媒体的闲谈</span></strong></p></li></ul><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2857">00:47:37</a> 什么人适合干VC？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3276">00:54:36</a> 基金的组织形态变化</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3484">00:58:04</a> 媒体的机构化与个人化</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3800">01:03:20</a> AI时代Kol的价值观</span></p>]]></description>
