  <item>
    <title>Vol.002｜对话王华东：过一种村上春树的人生</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6949682f0b60b7bf75e1dade</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6949682f0b60b7bf75e1dade</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 23 Dec 2025 04:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>王华东是我认识很多年的投资人。</span></p><p><span>几年前，他还是一个“中生代投资人”榜单中的一员。代表作还是移动时代的陌陌。尽管当时我们可以意识到他是的出色，但也没有意识到，他可以将这份出色持续这么久。</span></p><p><span>陌陌之后，这位经纬创投管理合伙人，又投资了理想汽车、海辰储能、沐曦、宇树科技等等。这都是过去几年最有代表意义的公司。</span></p><p><span>他一再破除了“VC只是偶然的产物”。</span></p><p><span>从互联网、制造业、再到AI与机器人，从美元到双币基金时代，他能够穿行其间的秘密到底是什么？这是我们这次访谈最想知道的答案。</span></p><p><span>访谈开始前，王华东和「elsewhere」认真聊了聊过去一年他的马拉松之路。建议不要跳过这段，这对我们理解王华东之所以是王华东，非常重要。</span></p><h2><span>🎙️ Voices</span></h2><p><span>王华东｜经纬创投管理合伙人</span><br><span>刘旌｜elsewhere别处发生</span></p><h2><strong><span>📀 BGM</span></strong></h2><p><span>Being Boring - Pet Shop Boys</span></p><h2><span>📱 Socials</span></h2><p><span>公众号｜视频号｜</span><a href="https://xhslink.com/m/6eWeP9XWetm" data-url="https://xhslink.com/m/6eWeP9XWetm"><span>小红书</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://b23.tv/V7sJ8yY" data-url="https://b23.tv/V7sJ8yY"><span>Bilibili</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://okjk.co/mKgqlp" data-url="https://okjk.co/mKgqlp"><span>即刻</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/68ff657d9c745a6e69da8fcf" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/68ff657d9c745a6e69da8fcf"><span>小宇宙</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/cn/podcast/elsewhere%E5%88%AB%E5%A4%84%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F/id1862365307" data-url="https://podcasts.apple.com/cn/podcast/elsewhere%E5%88%AB%E5%A4%84%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F/id1862365307"><span>Apple Podcast</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@elsewhere_news" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/@elsewhere_news"><span>YouTube</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://elsewherenews.substack.com/" data-url="https://elsewherenews.substack.com/"><span>Substack</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://x.com/elsewhere_news" data-url="https://x.com/elsewhere_news"><span>X/Twitter</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/elsewhere-news/" data-url="https://www.linkedin.com/company/elsewhere-news/"><span>Linkedin</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="http://elsewhere.news" data-url="http://elsewhere.news"><span>elsewhere.news</span></a></p><h2><span>⏱️ Timestamps</span></h2><ul><li><p><strong><span>Part1 六轮追投沐曦</span></strong></p></li></ul><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="812">00:13:32</a> 聊沐曦要先聊为什么投制造业</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1272">00:21:12</a> 沐曦融资历程、六轮追投</span></p><ul><li><p><strong><span>Part2 陌陌与理想汽车</span></strong></p></li></ul><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2067">00:34:27</a> 一些错过：字节和小红书</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2372">00:39:32</a> 投资理想的故事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2703">00:45:03</a> 宏大叙事而不赢家通吃的行业</span></p><ul><li><p><strong><span>Part3 无聊的人做科技投资</span></strong></p></li></ul><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4184">01:09:44</a> “有人评价你中国第一硬科技投资人”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4675">01:17:55</a> 中国AI行业完全没有泡沫</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4861">01:21:01</a> 王兴兴与机器人行业</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5718">01:35:18</a> 机器人之外的AI行业</span></p><ul><li><p><strong><span>Part4 投资行业最重要的是人</span></strong></p></li></ul><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6154">01:42:34</a> 做VC，天赋跟努力哪个更重要？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6616">01:50:16</a> 科技时代的经纬品牌</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/68ff657d9c745a6e69da8fcf/lldDfiKAe9iF1w2i-sD5bU9s3ZR-.m4a" length="115236508" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:58:38</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr9KM7NN9nzxBDmM1Pd8HMFPJ4rs.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.001｜对话刘元：和Manus的一周，和肖弘的十年</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6939783637f52a644e3ab538</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6939783637f52a644e3ab538</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 11 Dec 2025 04:31:52 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>想写刘元，是个拖延很久的计划。</span></p><p><span>最初是想等一等他早年投资的Momenta上市；后来又说等他加入真格的正好十年时。但总是各种阴差阳错。直到他投资的Manus爆火，但他又一次忧虑了起来：这会不会是半路开香槟。</span></p><p><span>很多接近刘元的人都知道，这位真格基金合伙人，是个浪漫、善意，以及感性的人。但2025依然是他情绪相当波动的一年。</span></p><p><span>这一年他哭过很多次。我大致统计了一下，在「elsewhere」与刘元的速记中，出现了16次“哭”，但也有——43次“哈哈哈”。</span></p><p><span>你会听到迄今为止最完整的关于Manus的故事、刘元和肖弘近10年的长跑，以及一个鲜有投资人会自陈的内心世界。</span></p><h2><strong><span>🎙️ Voices</span></strong></h2><p><span>刘元｜真格基金合伙人</span></p><p><span>刘旌｜elsewhere别处发生</span></p><h2><strong><span>📀 BGM</span></strong></h2><p><span>Under Pressure - Queen/David Bowie</span></p><h2><strong><span>📱 Socials</span></strong></h2><p><span>公众号｜视频号｜</span><a href="https://xhslink.com/m/6eWeP9XWetm" data-url="https://xhslink.com/m/6eWeP9XWetm"><span>小红书</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://b23.tv/V7sJ8yY" data-url="https://b23.tv/V7sJ8yY"><span>Bilibili</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://okjk.co/mKgqlp" data-url="https://okjk.co/mKgqlp"><span>即刻</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/68ff657d9c745a6e69da8fcf" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/68ff657d9c745a6e69da8fcf"><span>小宇宙</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/cn/podcast/elsewhere%E5%88%AB%E5%A4%84%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F/id1862365307" data-url="https://podcasts.apple.com/cn/podcast/elsewhere%E5%88%AB%E5%A4%84%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F/id1862365307"><span>Apple Podcast</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@elsewhere_news" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/@elsewhere_news"><span>YouTube</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://elsewherenews.substack.com/" data-url="https://elsewherenews.substack.com/"><span>Substack</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://x.com/elsewhere_news" data-url="https://x.com/elsewhere_news"><span>X/Twitter</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/elsewhere-news/" data-url="https://www.linkedin.com/company/elsewhere-news/"><span>Linkedin</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="http://elsewhere.news" data-url="http://elsewhere.news"><span>elsewhere.news</span></a></p><h2><strong><span>⏱️ Timestamps</span></strong></h2><ul><li><p><strong><span>Part1 这不是一场事先张扬的策划！</span></strong></p></li></ul><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="317">00:05:17</a> Manus视频爆火始末</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="749">00:12:29</a> “墙内开花墙外香”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1061">00:17:41</a> 为什么要做邀请码</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1162">00:19:22</a> 从未试图承接DeepSeek的流量</span></p><ul><li><p><strong><span>Part2 每个童话都会有结局</span></strong></p></li></ul><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1326">00:22:06</a> 肖弘从来不是一帆风顺的founder</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1783">00:29:43</a> 岂曰无衣，与子同袍</span></p><ul><li><p><strong><span>Part3 九年前射出的子弹</span></strong></p></li></ul><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2043">00:34:03</a> Manus的一周，刘元和肖弘的十年</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2351">00:39:11</a> 夜莺、Monica、Manus</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2569">00:42:49</a> 为什么肖弘的融资一直不顺？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3033">00:50:33</a> “我一直在等他创业”</span></p><ul><li><p><strong><span>Part4 我太需要一场胜利了！</span></strong></p></li></ul><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3923">01:05:23</a> 天呐，这里好多鹦鹉！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4253">01:10:53</a> 至今最浓墨重彩的一笔投资</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4510">01:15:10</a> 给徐老师的微信长文</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5064">01:24:24</a> 魔法的传承</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5310">01:28:30</a> 安宁的重复的美好</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5686">01:34:46</a> 如何保持少年感和好奇心</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5844">01:37:24</a> “Oceanic”</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/68ff657d9c745a6e69da8fcf/lmv99CLhxgIbb8HygeoesReyvmi-.m4a" length="107080952" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:50:14</itunes:duration>
